      "created_at": "2015-08-12T20:50:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Animus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/animus/48/1887_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Animus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>In reading a bunch of fan theories, I saw a mention of Fanatic being in Tactics, and a reference to her picture.&nbsp;1) Which set is she in?2) Does anyone have a link to a picture please?&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>She is in Ra's deck in Tactics. Base set. Easy to find if you have it. Pretty sure that posting card art is a no-no however unless Christopher, Adam, or Paul do it themselves.</p>",
