      "created_at": "2015-08-14T23:44:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There have been theories about each core set being dedicated to a different team; assuming this is correct, it's likely she'll appear with the rest of the Prime Wardens. That being said, I don't think GtG has ever actually confirmed or denied said rumors, so it's just speculation at this point.</p>",
